# Dragon's Rage Channeler surveils twice off its own trigger, putting a Mountain (land) and a Guerrilla Gorilla
# (creature) straight into the graveyard, while Chain Lightning and Lightning Bolt themselves resolve there too
# (sorcery, instant). Four card types among cards in the graveyard turns delirium on: the Channeler becomes 3/3
# with flying, and — with no [Handover] or Attack line at all — the unscripted default still has to send it in,
# because the channeler attacks each combat if able (CR 508.1d), which Bot2's life total below proves.

